Hi everyone

could any one tell me what is wrong in my syntax of Mplus?

*** ERROR in MODEL command
  Unknown variable(s) in an ON statement:  NR

Hear is my full syntax

 TITLE: Latent Regression Model for not-reached items
         that ignores omitted items;
  DATA:  FILE IS missing.dat;
  VARIABLE:
    NAMES ARE i1-i22 do1-do22 nr;
    USEVARIABLES ARE i1-i22 do1-do22;
    CATEGORICAL ARE i1-i22 do1-do22;
    MISSING ARE all (-99);
  ANALYSIS: ESTIMATOR IS MLR;
  MODEL: xi BY i1-i22*(d1-d22);
         [i1$1-i22$1](thr1-thr22);
         ! Identification with Var(xi) = 1 and E(theta) = 0
         ! using the MODEL CONSTRAINT command
         nr   (vnu);
         xi   (vxi);
         [nr] (mnu);
         [xi] (mxi);
         ! Latent Regression Model with the number of not-reached items (nr)
         ! as independent variable
         xi ON nr (regxi);
  MODEL CONSTRAINT:
  ! Only for model identification
  0 = mxi + regxi*mnu;
  0 = regxi**2 * vnu + vxi -1;
  ! Computing the item difficulties from thresholds
  new(b1-b22);
  b1=thr1/d1;
  b2=thr2/d2;
  b3=thr3/d3;
  b4=thr4/d4;
  b5=thr5/d5;
  b6=thr6/d6;
  b7=thr7/d7;
  b8=thr8/d8;
  b9=thr9/d9;
  b10=thr10/d10;
  b11=thr11/d11;
  b12=thr12/d12;
  b13=thr13/d13;
  b14=thr14/d14;
  b15=thr15/d15;
  b16=thr16/d16;
  b17=thr17/d17;
  b18=thr18/d18;
  b19=thr19/d19;
  b20=thr20/d20;
  b21=thr21/d21;
  b22=thr22/d22;
  SAVEDATA: FILE IS EAP_NotReachedOnlyModel.dat;
            SAVE IS FSCORES;

*** ERROR in MODEL command
  Unknown variable(s) in an ON statement:  NR

